    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064710/extras/e88308ad13faae64ed65b67762288dd4.poster.avif?t=1752245598\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064710/extras/e88308ad13faae64ed65b67762288dd4.webm?t=1752245598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064710/extras/e88308ad13faae64ed65b67762288dd4.mp4?t=1752245598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Luminescence is a Parkour/Platforming experience across the constellations of space in levels themed to real stars across the universe</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064710/extras/45fa7793f3cd36baa0fd259f83910b2a.poster.avif?t=1752245598\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064710/extras/45fa7793f3cd36baa0fd259f83910b2a.webm?t=1752245598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064710/extras/45fa7793f3cd36baa0fd259f83910b2a.mp4?t=1752245598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Illuminate the path</strong> with a unique visual mechanic displaying obstacles &amp; paths close to you<br></li><li><i><strong>Grapple, Wallrun, Slide, Strafe, Flip and more</strong></i> as you sprint towards the goal: Touching the stars of the Galaxy<br></li><li>Switch between <strong>First &amp; Third-person perspectives</strong> on the fly!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064710/extras/6a553f39952ba9c3cb7e8c44c96e52ab.poster.avif?t=1752245598\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064710/extras/6a553f39952ba9c3cb7e8c44c96e52ab.webm?t=1752245598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064710/extras/6a553f39952ba9c3cb7e8c44c96e52ab.mp4?t=1752245598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Unlock different colorful outfits through challenges</strong> that give game-changing special effects!<br></li><li><strong>Race against your friend's times</strong> with the Steam Leaderboard<br></li><li><strong>A large variety</strong> of Drum &amp; Bass, EDM and Atmospheric Soundtracks to move to</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064710/extras/e1937340278ea1fe2cfc8c645182b19c.poster.avif?t=1752245598\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064710/extras/e1937340278ea1fe2cfc8c645182b19c.webm?t=1752245598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064710/extras/e1937340278ea1fe2cfc8c645182b19c.mp4?t=1752245598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064710/extras/e88308ad13faae64ed65b67762288dd4.poster.avif?t=1752245598\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064710/extras/e88308ad13faae64ed65b67762288dd4.webm?t=1752245598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064710/extras/e88308ad13faae64ed65b67762288dd4.mp4?t=1752245598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Luminescence is a Parkour/Platforming experience across the constellations of space in levels themed to real stars across the universe</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064710/extras/45fa7793f3cd36baa0fd259f83910b2a.poster.avif?t=1752245598\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064710/extras/45fa7793f3cd36baa0fd259f83910b2a.webm?t=1752245598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064710/extras/45fa7793f3cd36baa0fd259f83910b2a.mp4?t=1752245598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Illuminate the path</strong> with a unique visual mechanic displaying obstacles &amp; paths close to you<br></li><li><i><strong>Grapple, Wallrun, Slide, Strafe, Flip and more</strong></i> as you sprint towards the goal: Touching the stars of the Galaxy<br></li><li>Switch between <strong>First &amp; Third-person perspectives</strong> on the fly!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064710/extras/6a553f39952ba9c3cb7e8c44c96e52ab.poster.avif?t=175224